---
import BaseHead from '../../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE, PHONE, PHONE_TEL } from '../../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
	<BaseHead title={`Sewer Camera Inspection Santa Clarita | ${SITE_TITLE}`} description="High-definition sewer camera inspections in Santa Clarita, CA. Locate clogs, roots, cracks, and other issues with clear video evidence." />
</head>
<body>
	<Header />

	<section class="page-hero">
		<div class="container">
			<h1>Sewer Camera Inspection</h1>
			<p>See exactly what’s happening inside your drain and sewer lines with HD video.</p>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="content">
		<div class="container">
			<div class="content-grid">
				<div>
					<h2>Know What’s Inside Your Pipes</h2>
					<p>A camera inspection is the most accurate way to diagnose drain and sewer problems. We insert a waterproof high-definition camera into the line and record the condition of the pipe walls, joints, and any obstructions.</p>
					<p>This is invaluable for locating the exact position of a blockage, identifying root intrusion, checking for cracks or collapses, and evaluating the overall condition of older sewer lines before buying or selling a home.</p>
					
					<h3>What You’ll Receive</h3>
					<ul>
						<li>Live and recorded HD video of the inspected line</li>
						<li>Clear identification of blockages, roots, offsets, or damage</li>
						<li>Location markers so any needed repair can be targeted</li>
						<li>Straightforward explanation of findings and recommended next steps</li>
					</ul>
				</div>
				<div>
					<h3>Common Uses</h3>
					<ul>
						<li>Diagnosing recurring or mysterious backups</li>
						<li>Pre-purchase plumbing inspections</li>
						<li>Checking lines after root cutting or major cleaning</li>
						<li>Evaluating older clay or cast-iron systems</li>
						<li>Confirming the success of a repair</li>
					</ul>
					
					<h3>Peace of Mind</h3>
					<p>Guesswork is expensive. A camera inspection gives you the information needed to choose the right repair or cleaning method the first time.</p>
					
					<div class="mt-2">
						<a href="/contact/" class="btn btn-primary">Schedule Camera Inspection</a>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="cta">
		<div class="container">
			<h2>See What’s Really Going On</h2>
			<p>Call to schedule a sewer camera inspection in Santa Clarita.</p>
			<a href={`tel:${PHONE_TEL}`} class="btn btn-primary">Call {PHONE}</a>
		</div>
	</section>

	<Footer />
</body>
</html>
